											>	kill suspicious process

>Differential Analysis - compare the current system against the baseline system												alternative: fc.exe
	Get-Service > baseline_services_2024-12-01.txt					get the list of services on the healty system, and save to a txt
	Get-Service > investigated-system_services_2024-12-01.txt			get the list of services on investigated system, and save to a txt
	$baseline=Get-Content .\baseline_services_2024-12-01.txt			set variable $baseline for baseline_services_2024-12-01.txt
	$current=Get-Content .\investigated-system_services_2024-12-01.txt		set variable $current for investigated-system_services_2024-12-01.txt
	Compare-Object -ReferenceObject $baseline -DifferenceObject $current		compare


